{"ID":"20240515131359-h82h0vq","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240515131359-h82h0vq","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515131359-h82h0vq\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515141939-6kbcwbj\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515141939-6kbcwbj\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:400,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515141939-6kbcwbj\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:269,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:269\u0026#125;","title":"082","type":"doc","updated":"20240515141939"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240515141939-6kbcwbj","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 817px;","id":"20240515141939-6kbcwbj","updated":"20240515141939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：2006/09/07"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"MI"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"F"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"身形胖壯"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/08/12"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"身重且腫，早上都很累。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右側腹痛，自認來自卵巢痛。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"經前乳房脹滿，易噁心、泛酸；經期很短，一天淨，經後則諸症改善。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"口中酸味重。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"胃口過佳。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大便秘（但服漢唐-33時則排便順暢），不排氣。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小便中黃。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"口渴，喜冷飲。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雙足溫。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"易出汗。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"細小無力。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黃乾。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有水腫，心陽不足，水氣不散，故身積水氣。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（1）麻黃三錢 炮附子三錢 細辛二錢 桂枝五錢 白朮三錢 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"茯苓五錢 豬苓三錢 澤瀉五錢"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"十帖，"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"九碗煮成三碗，"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早晚餐前各服一碗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）續服HT-33 澤蘭丸。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本病患身形胖壯，但心陽不足，故心臟無法負擔正常狀態下的身體功能運作，水氣因此容易蓄積而衍生諸症，就好像以較小的引擎驅動較重的車輛一般吃力。該現象也可從病患自述經過身體按摩推拿後自覺輕鬆、諸症改善的現象得到證明。至於病機的演變過程，乃因心陽不足、往上到肺的熱能不足，使肺陽也跟著不足；肺因而無法把藏於其中的水氣往下順暢送至腎，積於中焦則發噁心、泛酸。乳房中的奶水也因心肺陽虛而聚於乳房局部，導致乳脹明顯；小腸熱量受心陽虛影響也不足，僅少量奶水能下降經小腸熱量處理而出，故經期僅來一天即淨。而因病患能出汗，故僅覺身體腫脹感，而沒有真正產生明顯水腫。方義：本病患的脈象屬少陰證，但問診所得內容皆類似大柴胡湯或大承氣湯之相關症狀，因此倪師以麻黃附子細辛湯治療少陰證，並以五苓散將水濕排出；同時兼以HT-33處理中焦濕熱過盛兼便秘的問題。"}]}]}]}]}